  "body": "This allows user agents to experiment with better heuristics for not executing such scripts, as per https://github.com/WICG/interventions/issues/17.\n\n---\n\nNot sure what our policy should be on whether to merge this or not. I'd say for these type of \"may\" interventions, we might want to lower our usual bar of 2+ implementors actively planning to implement, in favor of there being no objections. What do the other editors think?\n\nIn the meantime, regardless of whether we merge it or not, this can serve as a patch for the intervention discussion at https://github.com/WICG/interventions/issues/17 to reference.\n",
